{"TV|…and it’s a packed house for the crosstown rivalry — Churchill vs Wooton, THE BIG GAME!":"assets/voice/0cb104e7c4bc.mp3","Christian|Classic. Half the county is at that game right now.":"assets/voice/784e8c7657c2.mp3","TV|Bulldogs driving down the field — Wooton’s defense is gonna have to dig in…":"assets/voice/88ebae720fe4.mp3","Agent|Welcome to Dulles! Flight home for the holidays?":"assets/voice/6496781cdc3e.mp3","Christian|You know it. Back in MoCo for the week.":"assets/voice/fa8904679910.mp3","Christian|Babe never changes. All right — Olivia’s first, then the swap. Let’s roll.":"assets/voice/8958305f8d47.mp3","Christian|Hey babe — just landed.":"assets/voice/dcbba0cd47d5.mp3","Stacy|Babe, finally! Are you coming to the swap later today?":"assets/voice/1cf09f205648.mp3","Christian|Of course. Headed there now.":"assets/voice/848003cc951e.mp3","Stacy|Great — can you swing by Olivia’s? She has a few items she wanted to bring.":"assets/voice/1cc9807c2e28.mp3","Christian|No problem.":"assets/voice/64ebbe8a350b.mp3","Stacy|Drive safe, it’s snowing! See you at the swap ❤️":"assets/voice/c46cb0117e4e.mp3","Christian|A flyer: KYLIE'S RUN CLUB — Wootton High track, Thursdays. \"Marathon prep. Hurdles. No excuses.\"":"assets/voice/2faf04058231.mp3","Kylie ❤️|You thinking about it? Because Maya is FAST and I need the practice. Come watch a lap!":"assets/voice/9daea6d40d17.mp3","DJ|Yo — you want a turn on the decks? The booth is yours, bronco. Make something.":"assets/voice/805343998983.mp3","DJ|You PUBLISHED it?? Bold. SoundCloud is gonna feel that one.":"assets/voice/741c46134c1c.mp3","Stacy|Already liked it. Obviously.":"assets/voice/3dd74b004174.mp3","Stacy|— and THAT is why you come to the swap this weekend — oh. You finally made it, babe! What took you so long?":"assets/voice/4941e63f92b6.mp3","Christian|I don’t even know where to start. Anyway — where do you want these?":"assets/voice/40e3f75dd934.mp3","Stacy|Just drop them over there, babe.":"assets/voice/cfc882232719.mp3","Christian|Oh — before I forget. I found some vintage cameras on the way. For you.":"assets/voice/6af426b206ae.mp3","Stacy|Full collection energy. TikTok is going to lose its mind.":"assets/voice/8c575e7d2d33.mp3","Christian|That’s everything — even Tre’s blanket-cardigan. May it find a loving home.":"assets/voice/a7b28c7ac950.mp3","Stacy|You’re the best. Okay — enjoy the party! DJ’s actually good tonight.":"assets/voice/c86d09875a94.mp3","DJ|Y’all ready?? Match the beat — hit E when the ring closes!":"assets/voice/d1e1f17eff93.mp3","Instructor|Welcome in. I’ll call a pose — pick it before the breath ends. And remember: the swap clothes are watching.":"assets/voice/62a084c2ca82.mp3","Instructor|That is… not that pose. But it IS a stretch of some kind.":"assets/voice/86ddc9051463.mp3","Stacy|Hey — we’re going to DC tonight with Mark and Kylie. You still remember that, right?":"assets/voice/1a675a251a01.mp3","Christian|Of course.":"assets/voice/432b1c8dc5bb.mp3","Stacy|Good. Then let’s go — they’re already down there!":"assets/voice/eadc118ac0bb.mp3","Olivia|E11EVEN. Miami. Every tooth clean, the whole philly fam here — this is the best night of my life.":"assets/voice/15597e6a31cb.mp3","The Fam|OLIVIA! OLIVIA! OLIVIA!":"assets/voice/a606d3dcb56d.mp3","Dr. Fritz|Olivia! Come in, come in. The family is in Miami this weekend — but YOU have teeth to clean first.":"assets/voice/3df26a37e245.mp3","Olivia|Wait — I'm the dentist here?? I thought I had an appointment.":"assets/voice/6ded2fc5d790.mp3","Dr. Fritz|Details, details. Sit in the chair — the glunk isn't going to scrape itself. And work fast…":"assets/voice/ce0b7ef97111.mp3","Dr. Fritz|…because if you're too slow, we bring in the OTHER Olivia. And nobody wants that confusion.":"assets/voice/cab8b2c513a3.mp3","Dr. Fritz|Every tooth — sparkling! Not a speck of glunk left. You know what that means…":"assets/voice/f22608a07c68.mp3","Olivia|Miami??":"assets/voice/e0225984cd05.mp3","Dr. Fritz|MIAMI. With the philly fam. And tonight — you dance at E11EVEN. You earned it.":"assets/voice/15f842bb95ee.mp3","Dr. Fritz|Clean… but slow. The other Olivia was ALREADY in the parking lot. Close one. Miami — but she's coming too.":"assets/voice/46333eef9904.mp3","Dr. Fritz|Too slow! OTHER OLIVIA — get in here! You, out of the chair. Come back when your wrists are faster.":"assets/voice/0f1e0531b9da.mp3","Kylie|Wootton track. Two laps, seven hurdles, three very fast friends. Marathon prep doesn't care about feelings.":"assets/voice/76562ec5ba61.mp3","Maya|New lap time or it didn't happen, Kylie. Ready… set —":"assets/voice/7d31713eb441.mp3","Maya|Okay that was actually fast. Same time Thursday, Kylie's Run Club forever.":"assets/voice/132fee0e24bb.mp3","Mark|Hey guys!":"assets/voice/9709e3d4f5de.mp3","Kylie ❤️|Let’s go ice-skating! We heard you’ve had a long day and have a lot to catch up on.":"assets/voice/a7eabd6350ee.mp3","Christian|You have NO idea. Airports, sushi, two Olivias, a basement guy…":"assets/voice/f42c9117fdf6.mp3","Mark|…two WHAT?":"assets/voice/540959ceb521.mp3","Christian|On the ice. I’ll tell you on the ice.":"assets/voice/7ade4bb446d6.mp3","Olivia|Christian! You made it! — yes, THAT Olivia. The real one. Probably.":"assets/voice/58703a5a124b.mp3","Mark|Same time next year?":"assets/voice/ec73cc786be0.mp3","Kylie ❤️|Same time every year. This is the whole point.":"assets/voice/107e56ea6ce9.mp3","Stacy|Carty Party — a MoCo holiday. Wouldn’t miss it.":"assets/voice/66b4edefa5d2.mp3","Christian|Wouldn’t trade it. Not even for a warm basement.":"assets/voice/2386e85f8039.mp3","Christian|Okay — car smells like winter. First stop Olivia’s, then the swap in Baltimore.":"assets/voice/a827fa7a5c06.mp3","Christian|Let’s see what’s on the radio…":"assets/voice/118d94771d5f.mp3","Passenger|Hey! Thanks for stopping — no time to waste.":"assets/voice/54e757f6ef3d.mp3","Passenger|I just ordered from Yo Yogi, but they close in 20 minutes. I’ll pay you double if you can get there.":"assets/voice/8bb0a428cae4.mp3","Christian|No problem — I’m heading that way now. Buckle in, bronco.":"assets/voice/255ca2540ea7.mp3","Passenger|They’re closing… we missed it. Ah man.":"assets/voice/e7e2ab384261.mp3","Christian|…Or did we? Watch this. (You can retry — I believe in us.)":"assets/voice/97321cbba70a.mp3","Passenger|YO YOGI! There — the little sushi spot with the fogged-up windows! You made it!":"assets/voice/a263fd6994b8.mp3","Passenger|Thanks, Christian. Seriously.":"assets/voice/90c1eb516abc.mp3","Christian|No problem. Forget about the tip, though.":"assets/voice/093359306918.mp3","Passenger|All right… but here — free roll of sushi. You earned it, bronco.":"assets/voice/62db13334b4e.mp3","Christian|Okay. NOW to Olivia’s. Baltimore after that.":"assets/voice/159f5b5ef773.mp3","Christian|Hi — I’m Christian. Here to pick something up for the swap later.":"assets/voice/c8671dd77134.mp3","Jim|She’s upstairs.":"assets/voice/9b7df650f554.mp3","Jim|…Help yourself to a cookie on the way out. Stacy’s mom made them. They’re the good ones.":"assets/voice/a853339273ce.mp3","Christian|A magnet card: DR. FRITZ — family dentistry. \"Olivia — don't forget your shift!\" …Olivia works for a dentist?":"assets/voice/daa9b214c1e0.mp3","Christian|Hey — here to pick up the stuff for the clothes swap.":"assets/voice/69af7da61e5d.mp3","Olivia|Thanks! It’s that pile right there.":"assets/voice/6bf0912c8d6b.mp3","Olivia|By the way — there’s one more thing, but it’s in the room across the hall. Do you mind grabbing it on your way out?":"assets/voice/96b6d97818bd.mp3","Christian|Sure, no problem.":"assets/voice/6cb311c3a3c6.mp3","Olivia??|Who are you?":"assets/voice/e2fb70fb31cb.mp3","Christian|Olivia?? I just saw you — across the hall…":"assets/voice/318907eb6589.mp3","Olivia #2|I’ve never seen you before in my life. But I AM Olivia.":"assets/voice/6244e1ca6bf0.mp3","Christian|…That’s weird. Anyway — she asked me to grab something.":"assets/voice/12fc13b5d45c.mp3","Olivia #2|Oh, you must be talking about Olivia. It’s downstairs. Hey — since you’re here, can you help take a quick photo?":"assets/voice/edc641a689cb.mp3","Olivia #2|That’s the one. Wait — yeah. That’s the shot. 📸":"assets/voice/4a20406576e3.mp3","Christian|Honestly? Kind of a natural.":"assets/voice/88b28ff3f116.mp3","Olivia #2|The item’s downstairs, by the way. In the basement.":"assets/voice/10d266252ce0.mp3","Olivia #2|You’re wrong. That’s — that’s horrible. Take it again.":"assets/voice/0dcc4aa132b7.mp3","Christian|Oh — hi. Tre?":"assets/voice/e9840118a016.mp3","Tre|Christian.":"assets/voice/3f3ddc821f93.mp3","Tre|You’re probably looking for the last item. I’ve been using it as a blanket, but — here you go.":"assets/voice/fcba19ec4b9c.mp3","Christian|Thanks, Tre. Hang in there.":"assets/voice/2c507a0f0f3d.mp3","Tre|It’s warm down here. That’s the thing people don’t understand about basements.":"assets/voice/0692b6135ce2.mp3","Christian|Two Olivias, a blanket-cardigan, and one unbothered Jim. Not bad for a Tuesday.":"assets/voice/335c90668971.mp3","Stacy|WAIT. Five?! Christian — the film grain on these is going to be INSANE. This is the best swap ever.":"assets/voice/efb71578fa2e.mp3","Stacy|Babe!! Vintage?! These are going to shoot SO well. You know me too well.":"assets/voice/c9eac8d4fed2.mp3","Stacy|Ooh — vintage! Look at this little lens. Thank you, babe.":"assets/voice/6c29ecc39fb8.mp3"}